			"notes": "## Changed\n- Updated for **Minecraft 26.3** (Fabric Loader 0.19.5+ / Fabric API 0.161.0+; NeoForge `26.3.0.7-beta`+). Requires Minecraft 26.3. Mod Menu integration bumped to its 26.3 build.\n\n## Fixed\n- Ported to the 26.3 APIs and data formats:\n  - **Mega Trees**: the giant birch/oak/acacia/cherry tree definitions moved to the game's new `worldgen/feature` format.\n  - **No Crop Trample** (Fabric): follows vanilla's reworked farmland.\n  - **Enderman block pickup**: follows the renamed `Enderman` class.\n  - The blasting/smelting recipes (blackstone from cobblestone, leather from rotten flesh) now state their cook time explicitly, as 26.3 requires. Times are unchanged.\n\n## Notes\n- NeoForge for 26.3 is still in **beta**; this build targets `26.3.0.7-beta`.\n- No config changes; every toggle carries over."
		},
